  "description": "Eun-Ho, who is popular for his pretty face and tall stature, is having a flower-like youth, but... is a repeater. Unable to just sit by and watch Eun-Ho like that, his mother asks Seong-Jun, Eun-Ho's childhood friend and one year older, to tutor him. Eun-Ho goes to Seong-Jun to thank him and run an errand for side dishes... \n\n...Huh? What are you doing now?\n\n(Source: Bookcube, translated)",
